<p>Your faceless visage is puzzling and emotionless, allowing you to more easily resist mind tricks.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 14, 20, 25, 30</acronym> mental save, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 31%, 41%, 51%, 60%</acronym> confusion immunity.</p>